Adds an interactive 'JMAP account' entry to the setup popup (next to Import
Configs) opening a small window that collects display name / email / user /
password / host / port (prefilled jmap.diegonmarcos.com:443) and writes the
account via the new CommsAccounts.createJmapAccount helper.

New files (merge-friendly): CommsAccounts.java, FragmentDialogJmap.java,
res/layout/dialog_jmap.xml, res/values/strings_comms.xml.
Upstream touch-points kept minimal: 2 hooks in FragmentSetup, 3 in ActivitySetup.
